{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your crystals wisely, collect and upgrade your cards!Buy equipment and runes to create powerful combinations and defeat increasingly stronger enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Card Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast collection of cards with unique effects\u2014build the deck you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-1.gif?t=1750667678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategic Deployment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The damage dealt each turn depends not only on card strength but also on how you position them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-2.gif?t=1750667678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple Goals, Fast-Paced Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach or exceed the target score to win, but be careful\u2014your enemies will keep getting stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-3.gif?t=1750667678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resource Management at the Space Station</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the space station, you can purchase cards, equipment, and runes, dismantle cards, and even upgrade them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-4.png?t=1750667678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Card Upgrade System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got a powerful card held back by tough conditions? Don't worry! Replace trigger conditions, add effects, and turn even ordinary cards into powerhouses with a single upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-5.png?t=1750667678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerful Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each piece of equipment offers unique effects and can be combined with your cards to create synergies and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-6.gif?t=1750667678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerful Rune System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runes boost your deck significantly. Play cards matching rune conditions to unleash powerful effects and stat boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-7.png?t=1750667678\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on the Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your character, deck, and runes to start your ever-changing card adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802670/extras/English_en_-8.png?t=1750667678\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802670?t=1750667678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storep